<title>SWEDEN: Shares in ABB up on order speculation.</title>
<headline>Shares in ABB up on order speculation.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish shares in international engineering company ABB AB rose three percent on the Stockholm bourse in Thursday morning trade.</p>
<p>At 1225 GMT, the share was up 24 crowns to 822 crowns, while the bourse's general index was up 0.45 percent.</p>
<p>&quot;The share is driven from Zurich,&quot; a Stockholm chief dealer said. &quot;It is rising because the Swiss share is rising. It is possible that investors are speculating in the company being on the verge of getting a large order.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1006</p>
